                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "2 Player Gameplay: https://youtu.be/5r4BxmYP-tA\nGanbatte is an arcade game for VR, about cats, in space, eating sushi. The gameplay involves trying to eat as much valuable sushi as fast as you can to get the highest score possible, within three timed rounds. Different types of sushi have different value, so you aim to eat the most valuable sushi, and the game can be played in a single player mode against an AI or in multiplayer mode. The game may appeal to kids or even a niche audience, but I think it is still over-priced currently, at £11.39. I personally would like to see more content added, such as more levels, environments, and maybe a global leader-board to give the game more replay value. (The controls are also a little bit awkward to use should you choose to play this through Steam on the Oculus Rift!) \nUpdate: A global leaderboard has now been added and the developer is working to improve the game!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1526760931,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1526900468,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 1,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.5,
