                        "written_during_early_access": true,
                        "developer_response": "Hi Jade, many thanks for your feedback and content suggestions. I have good news, the global leaderboard is available, and we're working hard to improve the game and bring more value. Re: controls on Rift, do you have a suggestion to improve it? Thanks again ^^",
